{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"quest-8031302","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-quest-8031302-quest-8031302-0","text":"没错，就是这声音！","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-quest-8031302-quest-8031302-1","text":"来吧，我将给予你树庭中最伟大的宝藏。","speaker":"卡利多托斯"},{"id":"divergent-universe-quest-8031302-quest-8031302-2","text":"闹鬼了！","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-quest-8031302-quest-8031302-3","text":"嘿！你这年轻人，怎么说话的？","speaker":"卡利多托斯"},{"id":"divergent-universe-quest-8031302-quest-8031302-4","text":"我渴望星琼。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-quest-8031302-quest-8031302-5","text":"可惜，这里没有财富，但有比财富更珍贵的东西——知识。","speaker":"卡利多托斯"},{"id":"divergent-universe-quest-8031302-quest-8031302-6","text":"我乃是伟大的智者卡利多托斯，留下的一缕神智，作为「目录」的大图书管理员。","speaker":"卡利多托斯"},{"id":"divergent-universe-quest-8031302-quest-8031302-7","text":"不就是鬼？","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-quest-8031302-quest-8031302-8","text":"你，你这，嘶——嘶，念在你尚有可教化的余地，姑且原谅你的愚钝。","speaker":"卡利多托斯"},{"id":"divergent-universe-quest-8031302-quest-8031302-9","text":"我懂了，是数字生命。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-quest-8031302-quest-8031302-10","text":"有小孩子不能看的吗？","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-quest-8031302-quest-8031302-11","text":"你们也网上冲浪？","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-quest-8031302-quest-8031302-12","text":"受黑潮的侵蚀，地下的网络逐渐坏死，真正保留下来的，也只有些许残卷。","speaker":"卡利多托斯"},{"id":"divergent-universe-quest-8031302-quest-8031302-13","text":"我靠！织网！","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-quest-8031302-quest-8031302-14","text":"大数据真是无处不在。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-quest-8031302-quest-8031302-15","text":"你看人的眼光真准。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-quest-8031302-quest-8031302-16","text":"来不及拒绝，一道炫目的光辉便渗入你的思维，将你的神识摄入盘根错节的根系当中。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-quest-8031302-quest-8031302-17","text":"你说的是谁啊？","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-quest-8031302-quest-8031302-18","text":"我不是，你不要乱说。","speaker":""}]}
